{
  "openapi": "3.0.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "GenTech Labs x402 Gateway",
    "version": "9.4.1",
    "description": "GenTech Labs x402 Gateway — 15 pay-per-call services for AI agents: DeFi intelligence, yield scanning, wallet analysis, agent identity/trust, market data and treasury defense. No account, no API key: an agent pays per call in USD Coin / USD₮0 / Global Dollar over x402. 6 settlement rails: base, avalanche, xlayer, algorand, solana, robinhood. Withheld services are listed under x-withheld WITH their reason rather than advertised.",
    "contact": {
      "email": "jordanjones0902@gmail.com",
      "name": "GenTech Labs",
      "url": "https://gentechlabs.net"
    },
    "x-guidance": "15 pay-per-call services, one path per service under `paths` (a templated route, plus a concrete probeable `examples` URL where we publish one — callers that cannot resolve a template should use the concrete form). treasury_defender (Airdrop & dust-token defense); defi_lp_analytics (DeFi LP pool analysis with efficiency scoring via De); wallet_analysis (Wallet portfolio analysis with token balances and US); agent_discovery (Search the ERC-8004 registry for on-chain AI agents); market_intelligence (Real-time crypto market price data); token_security (Solana token risk scoring and rugcheck analysis (11 ); lineage_guard (Data lineage blast-radius guard); deal_tracker (Game deal tracking, price-watch, and release radar (); agent_research (On-demand AI agent research and analysis); nft_search (NFT collection search across Solana via Magic Eden); score (MSS v2 model strength + sovereignty score (0-850) - ); route (Route across registered model providers with x402 se); providers (List registered model providers in the Sovereign Rou); gas_oracle (Live gas prices (gwei) for Ethereum, Base, Polygon); flow (Crypto ETF flow regime from settled SoSoValue data) Unauthenticated calls return HTTP 402 with x402 payment requirements (USD Coin / USD₮0 / Global Dollar, payable on 6 settlement rails: base, avalanche, xlayer, algorand, solana, robinhood). Pay per rail and retry with the x402 authorization header."
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "https://api.gentechlabs.net"
    }
  ],
  "security": [
    {
      "x402": []
    }
  ],
  "components": {
    "securitySchemes": {
      "x402": {
        "type": "http",
        "scheme": "bearer",
        "description": "x402 payment proof. Call without a proof to receive HTTP 402 with payment requirements (USD Coin / USD₮0 / Global Dollar, payable on 6 settlement rails: base, avalanche, xlayer, algorand, solana, robinhood). Pay per rail and retry with the x402 authorization header."
      }
    }
  },
  "paths": {
    "/v1/defender/classify/43114/0x8e53ad52980478794bb5b459b7cbdd836975e4cb": {
      "get": {
        "summary": "Classify an EVM token as KNOWN or SUSPICIOUS",
        "operationId": "treasury_defender_get",
        "tags": [
          "paid"
        ],
        "x-payment-info": {
          "price": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "currency": "USD",
            "amount": "0.005"
          },
          "protocols": [
            {
              "x402": {}
            },
            {
              "mpp": {
                "method": "evm",
                "intent": "charge",
                "currency": "USDC"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "responses": {
          "402": {
            "description": "Payment required"
          },
          "200": {
            "description": "OK"
          }
        },
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "chainId",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "description": "Numeric chain id (1 Ethereum, 8453 Base, 42161 Arbitrum)"
          },
          {
            "name": "token",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "description": "Token symbol or contract address"
          }
        ],
        "x-concrete-example": true,
        "x-resource-template": "/v1/defender/classify/{chainId}/{token}"
      }
    },
